---
name: Cisco ASA → OCSF
description: |
  Maps parsed Cisco Secure Firewall ASA events from the `cisco` topic to OCSF
  1.9 events and publishes them to the `ocsf` topic.
---

subscribe "cisco"
where @name == "cisco.asa"
cisco::asa::ocsf::normalize
this = ocsf_cast(ocsf_derive(this))
publish "ocsf"
